      "text": "grid turns an element into a CSS Grid container. You define rows and columns with grid-template-rows and grid-template-columns, then place children into named areas or specific cells. Grid excels at two-dimensional layouts, think page skeletons, image galleries, and dashboards. To learn more about this system checkout the Complete CSS Grid Layout Guide."
