    "description": {
      "html": "The <strong><code>:left</code></strong> <a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/CSS\">CSS</a> <a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Pseudo-classes\">pseudo-class</a>, used with the <a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@page\" title=\"The @page CSS at-rule is used to modify some CSS properties when printing a document.\"><code>@page</code></a> <a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/At-rule\">at-rule</a>, represents all left-hand pages of a printed document.",
      "text": "The :left CSS pseudo-class, used with the @page at-rule, represents all left-hand pages of a printed document."
    }
