      "text": "The onloadstart event can be used on a few different types of elements, including FileReader, HTMLMediaElement, and XMLHttpRequest. That said, you might consider using JS event listens for this also part of the netnet-standard-library) instead of HTML attributes (like onloadstart) because it keeps your JavaScript logic separate, making your code cleaner, easier to manage, and more flexible as your project grows."
