      "text": "<feBlend>, <feColorMatrix>, <feComponentTransfer>, <feComposite>, <feConvolveMatrix>, <feDiffuseLighting>, <feDisplacementMap>, <feDropShadow>, <feFlood>, <feGaussianBlur>, <feImage>, <feMerge>, <feMorphology>, <feOffset>, <feSpecularLighting>, <feTile>, <feTurbulence>, <filter>, <foreignObject>, <image>, <mask>, <pattern>, <rect>, <svg>, <use>"
