      "html": "<p>The <strong><code>kernelMatrix</code></strong> attribute defines the list of numbers that make up the kernel matrix for the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG/Element/feConvolveMatrix\" target=\"_blank\">feConvolveMatrix</a> element.</p>\n",
