      "html": "<p>The <strong><code>orientation</code></strong> attribute indicates that the given <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/glyph\" target=\"_blank\">glyph</a> is only to be used for a particular text direction, i.e. horizontal or vertical.</p>\n",
