    "status": "standard",
    "description": {
      "html": "<p>The <strong><code>&lt;feFlood&gt;</code></strong> SVG filter primitive fills the filter subregion with the color and opacity defined by <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG/Attribute/flood-color\" target=\"_blank\">flood-color</a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG/Attribute/flood-opacity\" target=\"_blank\">flood-opacity</a>.</p>\n",
      "text": "This SVG filter primitive fills the filter subregion with the color and opacity defined by flood-color and flood-opacity."
    },
