    "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG/Element/g",
    "status": "standard",
    "description": {
      "html": "<p>The <strong><code>&lt;g&gt;</code></strong> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG\" target=\"_blank\">SVG</a> element is a container used to group other SVG elements.</p>\n<p>Transformations applied to the <code>&lt;g&gt;</code> element are performed on its child elements, and its attributes are inherited by its children. It can also group multiple elements to be referenced later with the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG/Element/use\" target=\"_blank\">use</a> element. To learn more visit this <a href=\"https://svg-tutorial.com/svg/transform\" target=\"_blank\">SVG tutorial</a>.</p>\n",
      "text": "This SVG element is a container used to group other SVG elements.\n\nTransformations applied to This element are performed on its child elements, and its attributes are inherited by its children. It can also group multiple elements to be referenced later with the use element. To learn more visit this SVG tutorial."
    },
