    "status": "standard",
    "description": {
      "html": "<p>The <strong><code>&lt;polyline&gt;</code></strong> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG\" target=\"_blank\">SVG</a> element is an SVG basic shape that creates straight lines connecting several points. Typically a <code>polyline</code> is used to create open shapes as the last point doesn&#39;t have to be connected to the first point. For closed shapes see the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG/Element/polygon\" target=\"_blank\">polygon</a> element.</p>\n",
      "text": "The ` SVG element is an SVG basic shape that creates straight lines connecting several points. Typically a polyline` is used to create open shapes as the last point doesn't have to be connected to the first point. For closed shapes see the polygon element."
    },
