      "text": "Square brackets [ ] are used to create or access an Array, an ordered list of values stored under a single variable name. You can put any comma separated values inside (numbers, strings, even other arrays), like let colors = [\"red\", \"green\", \"blue\"]. To read a specific item back, use its index (position) inside brackets, counting from 0: colors[0] gives you \"red\"."
